          {
            "title": "Example: Classes",
            "id": 108257,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Boş bir <code>Movie</code> sınıfı oluşturmak için kodu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Movie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>class Movie</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Constructor",
            "id": 108258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Movie</code> sınıfına boş bir constructor ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Movie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"31\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>constructor() {}</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 108259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>title</code> ve ardından <code>genre</code> parametrelerini <code>Movie</code> sınıfının constructor'ına ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Movie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(title, genre) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"39\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>title, genre</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: this",
            "id": 108242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>this</code> kullanarak <code>windows</code> adında yeni bir özellik oluştur. Buna <code>windows</code> parametresinin değerini ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Building\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(doors, windows) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".doors = doors;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".windows = windows;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"95\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this.windows = windows;</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: new",
            "id": 108243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>2</code> kapısı ve <code>5</code> penceresi olan yeni bir bina örneği oluştur. Bunu <code>house</code> adlı bir sabitte sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Building\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(doors, windows) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".doors = doors;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".windows = windows;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" house = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Building(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(house);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"134\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Building { doors: 2, windows: 5 }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const house = new Building(2, 5);</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: methods",
            "id": 108274,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Calculator</code> sınıfına bir <code>print</code> metodu ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hesap makinesi mevcut değerini zaten saklıyor. Bu örnek değerini yazdıran bir <code>print</code> metodu ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"value\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: methods 2",
            "id": 108275,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Calculator</code> sınıfının içine <code>amount</code> parametresini alan bir <code>add</code> metodu kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>add</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>amount</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Calculator</code> sınıfına bir <code>add</code> metodu ekle. <code>amount</code> değerini alıp <code>this.value</code> değerini onun kadar artırmalıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"value\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>add</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>amount</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: methods 3",
            "id": 108276,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>amount</code> parametreli, <code>subtract</code> adlı bir metodu <code>Calculator</code> sınıfına ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"157\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>subtract(amount)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: call method",
            "id": 108277,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>calc1</code> adlı bir sabit oluştur. Yeni bir <code>Calculator</code> örneği oluştur ve bunu sabite kaydet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" calc1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Calculator();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"220\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const calc1 = new Calculator();</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: call method 2",
            "id": 108278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Toplama yapmak için <code>9</code> eklemek, <code>6</code> çıkarmak ve ardından sonucu <code>print()</code> ile görüntülemek üzere hesap makinesi metotlarını çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" calc1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Calculator();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.add(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.subtract(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.print();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"234\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"253\" /><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"268\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print();\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>calc1.add(9);</code>, ardından <code>calc1.subtract(6);</code> ve son olarak <code>calc1.print();</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>0</code> değerinden başlayarak <code>calc1</code> ile <code>9</code> ekle, <code>6</code> çıkar ve son değeri görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Calculator\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" add(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" subtract(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".value -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" calc1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Calculator();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.add(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.subtract(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calc1.print();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"234\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"253\" /><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"268\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print();\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"calc1.add(6);\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"calc1.subtract(9);\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>calc1.add(9);</code>, ardından <code>calc1.subtract(6);</code> ve son olarak <code>calc1.print();</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Instance",
            "id": 108568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Clothing</code> sınıfının bir örneğini oluştur ve bunu <code>shirt1</code> değişkeninde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Clothing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, size) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".size = size;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shirt1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Clothing(\" /><text value=\"&quot;tshirt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;L&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>new</code>, ardından <code>Clothing</code> ve sonra <code>(\"tshirt\", \"L\")</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Clothing</code> sınıfından adı <code>tshirt</code>, bedeni <code>L</code> olan <code>shirt1</code> nesnesini oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Clothing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, size) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".size = size;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shirt1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Clothing(\" /><text value=\"&quot;tshirt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;L&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Clothing()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>new</code>, ardından <code>Clothing</code>, <code>(\"tshirt\", \"L\")</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
